The demon god...has fallen?
Hong sensed it first;
The past two days have been really exciting. First, the sea of laws shook and the heavenly court was established;
He had obtained the honorable position, and he had just studied for a day, and before he had fully understood his responsibilities... the demon god fell silently?
It's really...
Nothing is permanent...
Then, the other supreme beings, including the supreme beings of the Star Spirit Tribe and the Demon Tribe, also sensed this fact;
There is no need to say more about the various tastes in my heart.
From then on, the last afterglow of the strange era disappeared...
.......
The seal of the sea of law origin of the first era is disintegrating and integrating into the universe without reservation!
All the essence in it has been extracted and absorbed...
Chu Yuan put away the Immortal Killing Sword Formation and Tai Chi Diagram.
His soul was so blessed that he sat cross-legged among the red lotus;
Will spreads in the sea of origin of law...
Between the eyebrows, the red lotus mark fades;
Instead, there is a jade dish that exudes clear brilliance;
It emerges slowly, it is noble and sacred, and cannot be blasphemed in the slightest!
It is the Tao Fruit that Chu Yuan merged into the sea of origin of law...
The savings of five eras are now fulfilled!
The expansion of the universe...has begun!
What started with it was Chu Yuan's Hedao...
From then on, there was no more sluggishness;
Everything is just waiting for it to fall into place!
The sea of the origin of the law manifested, hanging down thousands of rays of light, gently wrapping Chu Yuan's body;
In the end, his body became illusory, transparent, and finally disappeared...
The most intuitive change occurs in the real universe!
The energy density of the universe explodes wildly!
So the desolate planet was born with vitality;
Weak creatures become strong;
Ignorant things begin to have spiritual gestation...
In a deserted place on the edge of the universe, Calais and his relatives stood on a planet. He looked up;
Then I saw countless cosmic dust gathering together, and in a very short period of time, a new planet was born, slowly rotating.
It seems to span countless time;
It looks like a strong person is taking action to bring good fortune to it.
